[Unit]
Description=RANDOM nightly check of the stored pictures and GIFs (00:20 Paris, thirty minutes, between the evening's last look-alikes and the night's first: the reported ones, then thirty-five thousand of the stock in turn; the dead wait for the owner's button)

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-* 00:20:00 Europe/Paris
Persistent=false
RandomizedDelaySec=30

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
